          %h3#Introductions Introductions
          %p
            A survey of homotopy type theory aimed at
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/formal+logic"} logicians
            and
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/philosophy+of+mathematics"} philosophers of mathematics
          %ul
            %li#Shulman16
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Shulman"}> Michael Shulman
              ,
              %em Homotopy Type Theory: A synthetic approach to higher equalities
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1601.05035"}> arXiv:1601.05035
              )
          %p
            and one with an emphasis on
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/synthetic+geometry"} synthetic geometry
          %ul
            %li#Shulman17
